CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.4
-------------------------
 o Added AI provenance documentation (inst/PROVENANCE.md) and provenance
   comments in the source files.

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.3
-------------------------
 o Package renamed from spatialDESeq to spatialLagGLM; functions renamed to
   spatialLagGLM(), plotSpatialLag(), plotLagVolcano(),
   runSpatialLagExplorer() and makeMockSpatial().
 o Description, documentation and vignette now describe the model as a
   quasi-Poisson regression with a spatially lagged covariate; p-values are
   documented as exploratory.
 o Spatial weights are computed per sample_id and stored sparsely.
 o Added argument checks, 'assay.type' and 'size.factors' arguments, and a
   warning reporting failed gene fits.
 o plotSpatialLag(metric = "spatial_lag") now plots the spatial lag.
 o Rewrote the vignette and added unit tests for all exported functions.

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.2
-------------------------

BUG FIXES AND CLEANUP

    * Expanded Description paragraph length to pass substantive validation metrics.
    * Shifted BiocGenerics allocation array parameters into the primary Depends metadata field.

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.1
-------------------------

BUG FIXES AND CLEANUP

    * Updated test runner script to natively support testthat engine framework.
    * Formally declared BiocGenerics package dependency in metadata imports list.
    * Adjusted C++ attribute namespace documentation import formatting attributes.

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.0
-------------------------

NEW FEATURES

    * Initial release of spatialDESeq.
    * Added rcpp_spatial_weights C++ engine for fast physical tissue coordinate weight mapping.
    * Implemented parallelized spatial GLM framework with library-size normalization offset vectors.
    * Added plotSpatialDESeq, plotVolcano, and runExplorer interactive dashboard.
